{"name": "Draco Blade", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Fast-paced action combat -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/a1a5922ad08f056ebd23e4abc016219d.poster.avif?t=1780680859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/a1a5922ad08f056ebd23e4abc016219d.webm?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/a1a5922ad08f056ebd23e4abc016219d.mp4?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draco Blade boasts a fluid combat system that rewards aggressive gameplay, enemy juggling, and improvised combo strings. Dodge an enemy's attack just before you get hit to trigger<strong> Spirit Move</strong>, which temporarily slows down time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A world of dragons and secrets -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/15ea9aa17ba9d1637812334d199c3afd.poster.avif?t=1780680859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/15ea9aa17ba9d1637812334d199c3afd.webm?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/15ea9aa17ba9d1637812334d199c3afd.mp4?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get stronger by defeating enemies, discovering hidden paths, and scouring every corner of the world for new abilities. Can't progress any further? Then pick a different direction and come back when you're better equipped.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- No upgrade left behind! -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/7df00ef89f41ab73999a65faf9600ecb.poster.avif?t=1780680859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/7df00ef89f41ab73999a65faf9600ecb.webm?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/7df00ef89f41ab73999a65faf9600ecb.mp4?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All attack skills found in the game can be equipped at the same time, meaning that every upgrade you collect will remain useful throughout the entire game.\u00a0Rearrange your attack skills on the Skill Matrix to customize your own combo routes, and go for the highest combo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Razor-sharp bosses -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/eb285e0c5aec8175ac3cc1af8f4001ff.poster.avif?t=1780680859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/eb285e0c5aec8175ac3cc1af8f4001ff.webm?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/extras/eb285e0c5aec8175ac3cc1af8f4001ff.mp4?t=1780680859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 10 vicious bosses await you, each with completely unique theming, mechanics, and music. After defeating them, you may be able to absorb and utilize their powers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you reach the tail-end of this adventure?</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Draco Blade is a \u201cDragon-Action\u201d game that combines exploration and combat within a land inhabited by dragons. Slash your way through the world, slice your foes, and discover where you came from in this blazing adventure!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683360/43acec2a468c367e3efdd4245ca2e3aeecc0b242/header.jpg?t=1780680859", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Metroidvania", "Adventure", "Hack and Slash", "Dragons", "Exploration"], "developers": "Scruff0", "publishers": "Scruff0", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4683360", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/khNC6vnc78s", "first_seen": 1781215200.0, "review_rank": 431}